> "Two of us will chase them, and two of us…"

**GM** — *completing the thought*
> "Free these people."

**Zenvon** — *assigning roles*
> "So, me and, Veyra will go chase them, you guys free this,"

**GM** — *as Pip, pushing back on the assignment*
> "you're the, you're the guy with the fingers who knows how to open the locks, I'm the guy with the sword that knows how to."

**Zenvon** — *revising the plan*
> "Yeah, okay."
> "So, you and, veera can go behind the Redbrand Ruffian, and Sister Maela will help."

